{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Straight from the '90s, 90FX brings back the thrill and raw energy of early revolutionary racing games.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Staying true to its retro roots, the game features tight, precise steering and fast-paced action, enhanced with modern mechanics and fresh ideas inspired by newer titles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/88e31db0953f9fe6d0811354427b6cbd.poster.avif?t=1761280080\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/88e31db0953f9fe6d0811354427b6cbd.webm?t=1761280080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With up to 40 vehicles battling for position\u2014and optionally armed with weapons\u2014there\u2019s never a dull moment. Even when you're in the lead, danger is always just ahead: mines, and chaos from those behind keep every race unpredictable. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From wild first-lap pileups to explosive shootouts\u2014or even the occasional laid-back cruise, 90FX offers something for every kind of racer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surprisingly competent and adaptive AI (still being fine-tuned during Early Access) will gladly leave you in the dust if you make a mistake, or take you out with a missile when you least expect it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no rubberbanding here. Every crash, every overtaking move, every destroyed opponent truly matters. Success is all about skill and strategy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/abd2eae0c70e1736049821442da1dac3.poster.avif?t=1761280080\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/abd2eae0c70e1736049821442da1dac3.webm?t=1761280080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And whether you\u2019re racing with a keyboard or gamepad, the controls are built to feel natural and responsive on both\u2014every track, every turn, every shortcut is designed with both inputs in mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons follow the same design philosophy: intuitive and satisfying to use, with no friction between you and the fun of blowing up your rivals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/3db17a6658ca009a3c9da8c1e889d358.poster.avif?t=1761280080\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/3db17a6658ca009a3c9da8c1e889d358.webm?t=1761280080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visually, 90FX embraces a stylized, abstract aesthetic\u2014colorful, shiny, and instantly readable, capturing not what the '90s actually looked like, but what they felt like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game is designed to keep you fully in the moment, with clear and distinct visual cues for everything that matters on the track, all without sacrificing performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>So, what are you waiting for? Jump into 90FX and experience the '90s all over again\u2014louder, faster, and more explosive than ever.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3569060?t=1761280080","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/98baa5634517b5c9998d4cf762cc381b313d8349/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761280080","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/12f26fc79f270b010fb0944e3a942f2119d679ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761280080","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/12f26fc79f270b010fb0944e3a942f2119d679ec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761280080","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Straight from the '90s, 90FX brings back the thrill and raw energy of early revolutionary racing games.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Staying true to its retro roots, the game features tight, precise steering and fast-paced action, enhanced with modern mechanics and fresh ideas inspired by newer titles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/88e31db0953f9fe6d0811354427b6cbd.poster.avif?t=1761280080\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/88e31db0953f9fe6d0811354427b6cbd.webm?t=1761280080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With up to 40 vehicles battling for position\u2014and optionally armed with weapons\u2014there\u2019s never a dull moment. Even when you're in the lead, danger is always just ahead: mines, and chaos from those behind keep every race unpredictable. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From wild first-lap pileups to explosive shootouts\u2014or even the occasional laid-back cruise, 90FX offers something for every kind of racer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surprisingly competent and adaptive AI (still being fine-tuned during Early Access) will gladly leave you in the dust if you make a mistake, or take you out with a missile when you least expect it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no rubberbanding here. Every crash, every overtaking move, every destroyed opponent truly matters. Success is all about skill and strategy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/abd2eae0c70e1736049821442da1dac3.poster.avif?t=1761280080\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/abd2eae0c70e1736049821442da1dac3.webm?t=1761280080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And whether you\u2019re racing with a keyboard or gamepad, the controls are built to feel natural and responsive on both\u2014every track, every turn, every shortcut is designed with both inputs in mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons follow the same design philosophy: intuitive and satisfying to use, with no friction between you and the fun of blowing up your rivals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/3db17a6658ca009a3c9da8c1e889d358.poster.avif?t=1761280080\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/extras/3db17a6658ca009a3c9da8c1e889d358.webm?t=1761280080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visually, 90FX embraces a stylized, abstract aesthetic\u2014colorful, shiny, and instantly readable, capturing not what the '90s actually looked like, but what they felt like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game is designed to keep you fully in the moment, with clear and distinct visual cues for everything that matters on the track, all without sacrificing performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>So, what are you waiting for? Jump into 90FX and experience the '90s all over again\u2014louder, faster, and more explosive than ever.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Yaeko"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569060/0bf9ce66edb837075c2daefec3616f856fc11694/header.jpg?t=1761280080","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3569060/1411065098/fed0785c0678e1de665f4bd24ada74b5e9f10ed9/1756145443/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756154605","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3569060/1411065098/fe